<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mărisca</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				large inferior kind of fig</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pingues mariscae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					10, 415</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fatua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					7, 25, 7</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in apposition with ficus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 8</span></i>
			 (also in <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 18, 19, § 72</span></i>);
			so, mariscae fici, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 550,
			31</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the piles</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tumidae mariscae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 2,
					13</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
